## Accessibility Requirements

### Color Contrast

| Element | Minimum Ratio |
|---------|---------------|
| Normal text | 4.5:1 |
| Large text (18px+) | 3:1 |
| UI components | 3:1 |
| Focus indicator | 3:1 |

### State Indicators

- Never rely on color alone
- Use icons, text, or patterns
- Ensure focus is visible
- Provide loading announcements

